{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_28","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -Raw D:\\\\project\\\\.agents\\\\skills\\\\songcl_research_pipeline\\\\references\\\\formats.md\"","aggregated_output":"# 文档模板汇总 — songcl_research_pipeline\n\n本文件是流水线全部产出文档的**唯一格式源**。生成任何 pipeline 文档前先读对应模板，禁止凭记忆自由发挥。\n\n| # | 模板 | 写入路径 | 生成时机 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | [Tick 报告](#1-tick-报告) | `pipeline/reports/summary_<ts>.md` | 每次 cron tick / 用户前台询问（`_manual` 后缀） |\n| 2 | [终态结果分析](#2-终态结果分析) | `pipeline/analyses/<id>_<state>_<ts>.md` | 实验判定为终态后自动生成 |\n| 3 | [实验设计](#3-实验设计) | `pipeline/designs/exp_design_<ts>.md` | 自主/手动设计新一批实验时 |\n| 4 | [动机审查](#4-动机审查) | `pipeline/reviews/motivation_review_<ts>.md` | 每次自主设计前（exp_design 的上游） |\n| 5 | [消融方案](#5-消融方案) | `pipeline/designs/ablation_plan_<ts>.md` | PHASE1_REACHED 后出方案与用户讨论 |\n| 6 | [决策记录/索引](#6-决策记录与索引) | `pipeline/decisions/<ts>_<type>.md` + `_index.md` | 每次决策（log_decision.sh 自动写） |\n| 7 | [Crash 修复记录](#7-crash-修复记录) | `pipeline/bugfixes/bugfix_<ts>.md` | crash 自修复时 |\n\n---\n\n## 1. Tick 报告\n\n每次 cron tick 的 `pipeline/reports/summary_<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>.md` 和**用户前台询问状态**时，使用以下固定格式。**始终使用完整六段格式（0-5），不允许精简、不允许合并为单行**。即使没有任何变化，也要展开完整的表格结构和段落标题。删 24h 前旧 summary。禁止自由发挥。\n\n```\n================================================================================\n  Research Pipeline Report — <project_name>\n  <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS> (tick #<N>)\n================================================================================\n\n## 0. Goal Status\n  Target: mIoU ≥ X.XXXX | Champion: <id> X.XXXX | Gap: ±0.00XX | Phase: 1 (NOT YET) / 2 (ABLATION)\n  (从 pipeline/goal.json 读取，check_goal.py 结果。无 goal.json 时写 \"No goal defined.\")\n\n\n## 1. GPU Overview\n┌──────────┬──────┬───────┬─────────────┬──────────────────────────┐\n│ Server   │ GPU  │ Util  │ Memory      │ Process                  │\n├──────────┼──────┼───────┼─────────────┼──────────────────────────┤\n│ server-X │ 0    │ 95%   │ 18.6/24 GB  │ text_unet (pid 108985)   │\n│ server-X │ 1    │ 0%    │ 0.0/24 GB   │ — IDLE —                 │\n│ server-Y │ 0    │ 0%    │ 0.0/24 GB   │ — IDLE —                 │\n│ ...      │      │       │             │                          │\n└──────────┴──────┴───────┴─────────────┴──────────────────────────┘\nFree GPUs: server-X:1, server-Y:0\n(只列出本项目 SERVERS.yaml 中 role=gpu_server 且在 allowed_gpus 白名单内的服务器)\n\n## 2. Running Experiments\n| ID       | Config                        | Server   | GPU | Epoch    | Best mIoU | Acc@50 | spmIOU | No-Impr | Status     |\n|----------|-------------------------------|----------|-----|----------|-----------|--------|--------|----------|------------|\n| dec4     | model_early_exit_4_dec4       | server-2 | 1   | 29/50    | 0.4874    | 0.542  | 0.449  | 4/10     | running    |\n| text_unet| model_early_exit_4_text_unet  | server-3 | 0   | 21/50    | 0.4986    | 0.551  | 0.458  | 1/10     | running    |\n| ...      |                               |          |     |          |           |        |        |          |            |\n\n## 3. Queue Status\n| Position | ID   | Config                           | Status  | Depends On    | Server     |\n|----------|------|----------------------------------|---------|---------------|------------|\n| 1        | XXX  | ...                              | waiting | —             | server-X   |\n| 2        | YYY  | ...                              | waiting | XXX           | server-X   |\n| ...      |      |                                  |         |               |            |\nActive capacity: A active (R running, C claiming, W waiting) / N target → capacity OK / NEED MORE；candidate budget = B\n\n## 4. This Tick's Actions\n  - [自主早停] <action> — <result>\n  - [队列推送] <action> — <result>\n  - [代码同步] <action> — <result>\n  - [终态判定] <action> — <result>\n  - [实验设计] <action> — <result>\n  (无动作时写 \"No actions taken. All stable.\")\n\n## 5. Decisions Made\n  - [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] <type>: <decision> (见 pipeline/decisions/_index.md)\n  (无决策时写 \"No decisions this tick.\")\n\n================================================================================\n  Next tick: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM>\n================================================================================\n```\n\n**格式强制检查**:\n- 第 0 段: Goal Status — 每次必写。无 goal.json 写 \"No goal defined.\"，有则显示 target/champion/gap/phase\n- 第 1 段: GPU Overview — 只列白名单内的服务器和卡\n- 第 2 段: Running Experiments — 必须含 10 列(ID/Config/Server/GPU/Epoch/Best-mIoU/Acc50/spmIOU/No-Impr/Status)\n- 第 3 段: Queue Status — 队列顺序 + 深度判定\n- 第 4 段: This Tick's Actions — 每次必写，无动作也说\"No actions\"\n- 第 5 段: Decisions Made — 每次必写，无决策也说\"No decisions\"\n- **禁止精简格式**：不允许 `## GPU: server-4 GPU0(...), GPU1(...)` 这类单行合并。即使无变化，每个段落标题必须独立出现，GPU/Running 表格必须完整展开。\n- 结尾: Next tick 时间\n\n**用户前台询问**: 用户说\"查看 pipeline 状态\"/\"实验进度\"/\"pipeline 报告\"等:\n- 按六段固定格式现场输出\n- **必须同步写入** `pipeline/reports/summary_<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>_manual.md`。使用 bash `cat > file << 'EOF' ... EOF` 写入，内容即上述六段格式的完整输出。不要跳过这一步。\n- `_manual` 后缀区分 cron 触发 vs 手动查询，方便事后追溯\n\n---\n\n## 2. 终态结果分析\n\n每个实验判定为终态后，**cron tick 必须自动生成该文件**。后续实验设计的 Phase 1 分析主要读取这组文件。\n\n```\n================================================================================\n  Experiment Result Analysis — <project_name>\n  Experiment: <experiment_id> | State: <state>\n================================================================================\n\n## 1. Basic Info\n  - ID: <id>\n  - Config: <config_path>\n  - Server: <server> | GPU: <gpu_id>\n  - Started: <start_time> | Finished: <end_time> | Duration: <Xs/h>\n  - State: done_complete | done_earlystop | crashed\n\n## 2. Best Metrics\n  | Metric   | Value  | @ Epoch |\n  |----------|--------|---------|\n  | mIoU     | X.XXXX | N       |\n  | Acc@50   | X.XXX  | N       |\n  | spmIOU   | X.XXXX | N       |\n  (if crashed: last saved mIoU before crash)\n\n## 3. Convergence Summary\n  - Best first reached at: epoch <N>\n  - Subsequent no_improve epochs: <K> (if early-stopped)\n  - Final epoch best: mIoU=X.XXXX vs historical best=X.XXXX\n  - (简要描述收敛形态: 快速上升后平台/震荡/一直未收敛)\n\n## 4. Comparison\n  - vs baseline (<baseline_id>): γ = +0.00XX (有效) / -0.00XX (失败) / ≈0 (持平)\n  - vs current champion (<champion_id>): γ = ±0.00XX\n  - (列出所有可对比的前置实验)\n\n## 5. Conclusion\n  - 结论: [有效] / [失败] / [持平]\n  - 解释: <一句话说清这个实验证明了什么>\n  - 对后续实验设计的建议: <复现验证? 扩展该方向? 放弃?>\n\n## 6. Crash Info (if crashed)\n  - Error type: <import / CUDA OOM / dimension mismatch / ...>\n  - Error message excerpt: <first 5 lines>\n  - Auto-fix attempt: <Y/N> — <retries> retries, result: <fixed/abandoned>\n================================================================================\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. 实验设计\n\n`pipeline/designs/exp_design_<ts>.md`，7 段格式：\n\n```\n================================================================================\n  Experiment Design — <project_name>\n  <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\n================================================================================\n\n## 1. Motivation（为什么设计这批实验）\n  - 项目动机（直接引用 goal.json description）: <goal.description>\n  - 故事线当前状态: 已验证的假设 / 未验证的假设 / 缺口\n  - 触发原因: running+claiming+waiting < target_active，candidate_budget=B / Phase 2 消融计划确认\n  - 这批变体在故事线中的角色: 验证假设X / 排除方向Y / 消融确认Z\n\n## 2. Current Best Results（基于什么数据做决策）\n| Experiment ID | Config                  | State          | Best mIoU | Acc@50 | spmIOU | Epochs |\n|---------------|-------------------------|----------------|-----------|--------|--------|--------|\n| ...           | ...                     | done_complete  | 0.5012    | 0.552  | 0.460  | 50     |\n| ...           | ...                     | done_earlystop | 0.4874    | 0.542  | 0.449  | 29     |\n  (来源: pipeline/analyses/ 下各实验终态分析 + experiments.csv + pipeline/decisions/_index.md)\n\n## 3. Analysis & Direction（方向分析）\n  ### 3.1 哪些方向有效（> baseline）\n    - <方向A>: best=X.XXXX, γ=+0.00XX vs baseline, 机制分析: ...\n  ### 3.2 哪些方向失败（< baseline 或持平）\n    - <方向B>: best=X.XXXX, γ=-0.00XX vs baseline, 失败原因推测: ...\n  ### 3.3 哪些尚未消融\n    - <方向C>: roadmap 计划但未跑, 优先级: high/medium/low\n  ### 3.4 结论\n    - 下一步选择理由（为什么这批设计比别的方向更值得投入）\n\n## 4. Experiment Plan（具体做什么）\n| # | ID            | Config Path            | Purpose / Hypothesis                          | Expected Result            | Priority | Depends On |\n|---|---------------|------------------------|-----------------------------------------------|----------------------------|----------|------------|\n| 1 | <id>          | configs/.../xxx.yaml   | <这个实验验证什么假设? 为什么预期> 0.50?       | > baseline 0.4956          | P0       | —          |\n| 2 | <id>          | configs/.../yyy.yaml   | <假设>                                         | > current best 0.5012      | P1       | <id1>      |\n| 3 | <id>          | configs/.../zzz.yaml   | <假设>                                         | complement evidence chain  | P2       | —          |\n\n## 5. GPU Allocation Plan（GPU 分配计划）\n| Server   | GPU | Assignment              | Config                       | Justification            |\n|----------|-----|-------------------------|------------------------------|--------------------------|\n| server-4 | 0   | 当前 running: l1_refine | ...                          | —                        |\n| server-4 | 1   | 当前 running: l1_detail | ...                          | —                        |\n| server-4 | 0   | Next: <id>              | configs/.../xxx.yaml         | first free card gets P0  |\n| server-4 | 1   | Next: <id>              | configs/.../yyy.yaml         | second card gets P1      |\n  空闲卡均为 FIFO 队列顺序分配，不绑定卡号(gpu 字段不写或写 None)\n\n## 6. Implementation Checklist（实施清单）\n  - [ ] 检查现有 config 是否可直接复用或仅需 YAML 参数变更\n  - [ ] 如需新 model 代码: <描述变更内容, 文件路径, 预计行数>\n  - [ ] 创建 config YAML: configs/<path>/<name>.yaml\n  - [ ] git add + commit + push\n  - [ ] **sync 到所有可用服务器**（见 SKILL.md「代码同步规则」）\n  - [ ] 更新 pipeline/queue.json (追加到 gpu_queues.server-X 队尾)\n  - [ ] 验证: 下次 cron tick 跑 pipeline_monitor 确认新任务正常启动\n\n## 7. Risk Assessment（风险评估）\n  - 代码风险: （是否涉及新 model 包 / 结构性改动 / CUDA 扩展?）\n  - 资源风险: （是否需要更多 GPU 显存? 是否影响其他项目?）\n  - 数据风险: （是否需要新数据集? 现有数据够不够?）\n  - 失败回退: （如果 crash 3 次，怎么处理? 跳回哪个方向?）\n================================================================================\n  Status: DRAFT | APPROVED | IMPLEMENTED\n  Designed by: Research Pipeline (autonomous)\n  Created: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM>\n================================================================================\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. 动机审查\n\n`pipeline/reviews/motivation_review_<ts>.md`，6 段格式。是 exp_design 的**上游分析**，每次自主设计实验前必须生成。\n\n```\n================================================================================\n  Motivation Review — <project_name>\n  <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\n================================================================================\n\n## 1. Goal\n  - 引用 pipeline/goal.json 完整内容\n  - 当前 target / champion / gap\n\n## 2. Story Status（故事线状态）\n  | 假设 | 状态 | 证据 | 缺口 |\n  |------|------|------|------|\n  | 聚类路由提升特征表达 | confirmed | posA_l1 0.5012 vs base 0.4894 (γ=+0.0118) | 需要消融哪些设计必要 |\n  | ... | partial | ... | ... |\n\n## 3. Experiment Assessment（已有实验的动机视角评估）\n  对每个已完成实验:\n  | Experiment | mIoU | 与动机的关系 | 对故事线贡献 |\n  |------------|------|-------------|-------------|\n  | posA_l1 | 0.5012 | 直接验证 cluster_attn 路由 | 确认核心假设 ✓ |\n  | posB | 0.4953 | 消融位置编码类型 | 排除 posB, posA 最优 |\n  | ... | ... | ... | ... |\n\n## 4. Gap Analysis（Q1: 故事缺什么）\n  - 已验证: ...\n  - 未验证: ...\n  - 矛盾/疑问: ...\n\n## 5. Design Rationale（Q2+Q3: 为什么设计这批变体）\n  - 每个变体填补哪个缺口\n  - 预期结果对故事线的推进\n\n## 6. Next Batch\n  → 见 pipeline/designs/exp_design_<ts>.md\n================================================================================\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. 消融方案\n\n`pipeline/designs/ablation_plan_<ts>.md`，PHASE1_REACHED 后生成、与用户讨论用：\n\n```\n================================================================================\n  Ablation Plan — <project_name>\n  Champion: <champion_id> (mIoU=X.XXXX, config=<path>)\n  <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\n================================================================================\n\n## 1. Champion Architecture Analysis\n  - Config: configs/.../xxx.yaml\n  - Model: <model_package>\n  - Key design choices:\n    1. <设计选择1>: <描述> (config 字段: xxx)\n    2. <设计选择2>: <描述> (config 字段: yyy)\n    3. ...\n\n## 2. Proposed Ablations\n| # | ID | 消融什么 | 对照实验 | 假设 | 预计 Δ | Priority |\n|---|----|---------|---------|------|--------|----------|\n| 1 | abl-XX | 去掉 L1 loss | l1_weight=0 | L1 对收敛稳定关键 | -0.005~-0.010 | P0 |\n| 2 | abl-YY | pos encoding A→B | pos_enc=B | posA 优于 B | -0.003~-0.008 | P1 |\n| 3 | abl-ZZ | 关掉 refine | refine=false | refine 收益 0.003 | -0.003 | P1 |\n\n## 3. Implementation Details\n  (每个消融的 config 路径、改动点、是否需要新 model 代码)\n\n## 4. GPU Allocation\n  (消融实验的排队计划，与现有队列的优先级协调)\n\n================================================================================\n  Status: DRAFT → DISCUSSING → APPROVED → IMPLEMENTING → DONE\n  Created: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM>\n  Approved: (用户确认时间)\n================================================================================\n```\n\n---\n\n## 6. 决策记录与索引\n\n单次决策 `pipeline/decisions/<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>_<type>.md`（由 `log_decision.sh` 写入，无需手写）：\n\n```\n# <project> 决策记录\n\n- **时间**: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\n- **类型**: early_stop | queue_push | next_batch | route_change | question | manual | manual_batch | other\n- **问题**: <当时面临的选择，含关键数字>\n- **决策**: <具体动作，哪个 config、哪台服务器、哪块 GPU>\n- **依据**: <判断逻辑>\n- **证据**: <数据来源，如 pipeline_monitor 输出、experiments.csv 等>\n```\n\n索引 `pipeline/decisions/_index.md`：\n\n```\n# <project> 决策索引\n\n| 时间 | 类型 | 问题 | 决策 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| 2026-07-17 06:56:46 | route_change | A3 true_route 已 kill... | 推送 B4 refine 变体... |\n```\n\n---\n\n## 7. Crash 修复记录\n\n`pipeline/bugfixes/bugfix_<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>.md`：\n\n````\n# Bugfix: <简短描述>\n\n- **时间**: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\n- **实验**: <experiment_id>\n- **错误类型**: <import / CUDA OOM / dimension mismatch / ...>\n- **错误日志摘要**:\n  ```\n  <关键错误行>\n  ```\n- **根因**: <一句话定位>\n- **修复**:\n  ```diff\n  <修复的 diff>\n  ```\n- **重试**: 第 <N> 次，结果: <fixed / still failing / abandoned>\n````\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content -Raw AdaRES/ipdn/model_paper5/adares_b4_query_competition/dec.py'","aggregated_output":"import torch\r\nimport torch.nn as nn\r\nfrom .sample_model import SamplingModule\r\nimport ipdn.torch.nn_new.functional as F\r\nfrom ipdn.torch.nn_new import MultiheadAttention\r\n\r\nclass ThreeLayerMLP(nn.Module):\r\n    \"\"\"A 3-layer MLP with normalization and dropout.\"\"\"\r\n\r\n    def __init__(self, dim, out_dim):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        self.net = nn.Sequential(\r\n            nn.Conv1d(dim, dim, 1, bias=False),\r\n            nn.BatchNorm1d(dim),\r\n            nn.ReLU(),\r\n            nn.Dropout(0.3),\r\n            nn.Conv1d(dim, dim, 1, bias=False),\r\n            nn.BatchNorm1d(dim),\r\n            nn.ReLU(),\r\n            nn.Dropout(0.3),\r\n            nn.Conv1d(dim, out_dim, 1)\r\n        )\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, x):\r\n        \"\"\"Forward pass, x can be (B, dim, N).\"\"\"\r\n        return self.net(x)\r\n\r\nclass CrossAttentionLayer(nn.Module):\r\n\r\n    def __init__(self, d_model=256, nhead=8, dropout=0.0):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        self.attn = MultiheadAttention(d_model, nhead, dropout=dropout, batch_first=True)\r\n        self.norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n        self.dropout = nn.Dropout(dropout)\r\n        self._reset_parameters()\r\n        self.nhead = nhead\r\n\r\n    def _reset_parameters(self):\r\n        for p in self.parameters():\r\n            if p.dim() > 1:\r\n                nn.init.xavier_uniform_(p)\r\n\r\n    def with_pos_embed(self, tensor, pos):\r\n        return tensor if pos is None else tensor + pos\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, source, query, batch_mask=None, attn_mask=None, pe=None, att_weights=None):\r\n        \"\"\"\r\n        source (B, N_p, d_model)\r\n        batch_offsets Tensor (b, n_p)\r\n        query Tensor (b, n_q, d_model)\r\n        attn_masks Tensor (b, n_q, n_p)\r\n        \"\"\"\r\n        B = query.shape[0]\r\n        query = self.with_pos_embed(query, pe)\r\n        k = v = source\r\n        if attn_mask is not None:\r\n            attn_mask = attn_mask.unsqueeze(1).repeat(1, self.nhead, 1, 1).view(B*self.nhead, query.shape[1], k.shape[1])\r\n            output, output_weight, src_weight = self.attn(query, k, v, key_padding_mask=batch_mask, attn_mask=attn_mask, att_weights =att_weights)  # (1, 100, d_model)\r\n        else:\r\n            output, output_weight, src_weight = self.attn(query, k, v, key_padding_mask=batch_mask, att_weights =att_weights)\r\n        self.dropout(output)\r\n        output = output + query\r\n        self.norm(output)\r\n\r\n        return output, output_weight, src_weight # (b, n_q, d_model), (b, n_q, n_v)\r\n\r\nclass SelfAttentionLayer(nn.Module):\r\n\r\n    def __init__(self, d_model=256, nhead=8, dropout=0.0, glu = False):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        self.attn = MultiheadAttention(\r\n            d_model,\r\n            nhead,\r\n            dropout=dropout,\r\n            batch_first=True,\r\n        )\r\n        self.nhead = nhead\r\n        self.norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n        self.dropout = nn.Dropout(dropout)\r\n        self.glu = glu\r\n        if glu:\r\n            self.glu_p = nn.Linear(d_model, d_model)\r\n            self.glu_g = nn.Linear(d_model, d_model)\r\n\r\n    def with_pos_embed(self, tensor, pos):\r\n        return tensor if pos is None else tensor + pos\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, x, x_mask=None, attn_mask=None, pe=None, norm=True, att_weights=None):\r\n        \"\"\"\r\n        x Tensor (b, n_w, c)\r\n        x_mask Tensor (b, n_w)\r\n        \"\"\"\r\n        B = x.shape[0]\r\n        q = k = self.with_pos_embed(x, pe)\r\n        if attn_mask is not None:\r\n            attn_mask = attn_mask.unsqueeze(1).repeat(1, self.nhead, 1, 1).view(B*self.nhead, q.shape[1], k.shape[1])\r\n            output, output_weight, src_weight = self.attn(q, k, x, key_padding_mask=x_mask, attn_mask=attn_mask, att_weights =att_weights)  # (1, 100, d_model)\r\n        else:\r\n            output, output_weight, src_weight = self.attn(q, k, x, key_padding_mask=x_mask, att_weights =att_weights)\r\n        if self.glu:\r\n            output = self.glu_p(output) * (self.glu_g(output).sigmoid())\r\n        output = self.dropout(output) + x\r\n        if norm: output = self.norm(output)\r\n        return output\r\n\r\nclass FFN(nn.Module):\r\n\r\n    def __init__(self, d_model, hidden_dim, dropout=0.0, activation_fn='relu'):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        if activation_fn == 'relu':\r\n            self.net = nn.Sequential(\r\n                nn.Linear(d_model, hidden_dim),\r\n                nn.ReLU(),\r\n                nn.Dropout(dropout),\r\n                nn.Linear(hidden_dim, d_model),\r\n                nn.Dropout(dropout),\r\n            )\r\n        elif activation_fn == 'gelu':\r\n            self.net = nn.Sequential(\r\n                nn.Linear(d_model, hidden_dim),\r\n                nn.GELU(),\r\n                nn.Dropout(dropout),\r\n                nn.Linear(hidden_dim, d_model),\r\n                nn.Dropout(dropout),\r\n            )\r\n        self.norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, x, norm=True):\r\n        output = self.net(x)\r\n        output = output + x\r\n        if norm: output = self.norm(output)\r\n        return output\r\n\r\nclass MLP(nn.Module):\n    \"\"\" Very simple multi-layer perceptron (also called FFN)\"\"\"\n\r\n    def __init__(self, input_dim, hidden_dim, output_dim, num_layers):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        self.num_layers = num_layers\r\n        h = [hidden_dim] * (num_layers - 1)\r\n        self.layers = nn.ModuleList(nn.Linear(n, k) for n, k in zip([input_dim] + h, h + [output_dim]))\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, x):\r\n        for i, layer in enumerate(self.layers):\n            x = F.relu(layer(x)) if i < self.num_layers - 1 else layer(x)\n        return x\n\n\nclass QueryCompetitionIndicator(nn.Module):\n    \"\"\"Predict confidence from a query and its overlapping competitors.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, d_model):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.query_norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\n        self.evidence_norm = nn.LayerNorm(3 * d_model + 1)\n        self.head = nn.Sequential(\n            nn.Linear(3 * d_model + 1, d_model),\n            nn.GELU(),\n            nn.Linear(d_model, d_model),\n            nn.GELU(),\n            nn.Linear(d_model, 2),\n        )\n\n    def forward(self, query, pred_masks, batch_mask):\n        valid = (~batch_mask).unsqueeze(1).to(pred_masks.dtype)\n        probabilities = pred_masks.sigmoid() * valid\n        areas = probabilities.sum(-1)\n        intersection = torch.einsum(\n            'bim,bjm->bij', probabilities, probabilities\n        )\n        union = areas.unsqueeze(-1) + areas.unsqueeze(1) - intersection\n        overlap = intersection / union.clamp_min(1e-6)\n        diagonal = torch.eye(\n            overlap.shape[-1], dtype=torch.bool, device=overlap.device\n        ).unsqueeze(0)\n        overlap = overlap.masked_fill(diagonal, 0.0)\n\n        competition = overlap / overlap.sum(-1, keepdim=True).clamp_min(1e-6)\n        normalized_query = self.query_norm(query)\n        context = torch.einsum('bij,bjd->bid', competition, normalized_query)\n        max_overlap = overlap.max(-1).values.unsqueeze(-1)\n        evidence = torch.cat(\n            [\n                normalized_query,\n                context,\n                normalized_query - context,\n                max_overlap,\n            ],\n            dim=-1,\n        )\n        return self.head(self.evidence_norm(evidence))\n    \r\n    \r\nclass DEC(nn.Module):\r\n    \"\"\"\r\n    in_channels List[int] (4,) [64,96,128,160]\r\n    \"\"\"\r\n    def __init__(\r\n        self,\r\n        num_layer=6,\r\n        num_class=256,\r\n        in_channel=32,\r\n        d_model=256,\r\n        nhead=8,\r\n        hidden_dim=1024,\r\n        dropout=0.0,\r\n        activation_fn='relu',\r\n        iter_pred=False,\r\n        attn_mask=False,\r\n        sampling_module=None,\r\n        kernel='top1',\r\n        global_feat='mean',\r\n        lang_att=False,\r\n        contrastive_align_loss=False,\r\n        num_proposal_fine=512,\r\n        num_proposal_query = [128,64,32,16,8,4],\r\n        num_proposal_query_inst = [128,64,32,16,8,4]\r\n    ):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        self.num_layer = num_layer\r\n        self.num_class = num_class\r\n        self.d_model = d_model\r\n        self.input_proj = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(in_channel, d_model), nn.LayerNorm(d_model), nn.ReLU())\r\n        \r\n        self.input_proj_2d = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(1024, d_model*2),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(d_model*2, d_model),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(d_model, d_model))#clip\r\n        self.sum_norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n        \r\n        self.lang_att = lang_att\r\n        self.contrastive_align_loss = contrastive_align_loss\r\n\r\n        H = 768\r\n        self.lang_proj = nn.Linear(H, d_model)\r\n        self.lang_norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n        \r\n        if sampling_module is not None:\r\n            self.sampling_module = SamplingModule(**sampling_module)\r\n        else:\r\n            self.sampling_module = None\r\n        self.num_proposal_fine = num_proposal_fine\r\n        self.num_proposal_query = num_proposal_query\r\n        self.num_proposal_query_inst = num_proposal_query_inst\r\n        self.query_generator = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(d_model, d_model),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(d_model, d_model),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(d_model, d_model))\r\n        \r\n        # DDI and SWA\r\n        self.qia_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.qia_layers_fine = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.qla_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.qqa_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.qqa_ffn_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.qia_ffn_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.sem_cls_heads = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        # self.scg = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.lqg = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        if self.lang_att:\r\n            self.lla_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n            self.lia_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n            self.ila_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n            self.lia_ffn_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n            self.ila_ffn_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        for i in range(num_layer):\r\n            self.qia_layers.append(CrossAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.qia_layers_fine.append(CrossAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.qla_layers.append(CrossAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.qqa_layers.append(SelfAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.qqa_ffn_layers.append(FFN(d_model, hidden_dim, dropout, activation_fn))\r\n            self.qia_ffn_layers.append(FFN(d_model, hidden_dim, dropout, activation_fn))\r\n            \r\n            self.sem_cls_heads.append(ThreeLayerMLP(d_model, self.num_class))\r\n            # self.scg.append(SelfAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.lqg.append(CrossAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n\r\n            self.lla_layers.append(SelfAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.lia_layers.append(CrossAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.ila_layers.append(CrossAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.lia_ffn_layers.append(FFN(d_model, hidden_dim, dropout, activation_fn))    \r\n            self.ila_ffn_layers.append(FFN(d_model, hidden_dim, dropout, activation_fn))    \r\n        self.norm_qqa = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n\r\n        self.sem_cls_head = ThreeLayerMLP(d_model, self.num_class)\r\n\r\n        self.out_norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n        self.out_score = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(d_model, d_model), nn.ReLU(), nn.Linear(d_model, 1))\r\n        self.x_mask = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(in_channel, d_model), nn.ReLU(), nn.Linear(d_model, d_model))\r\n        \r\n        self.indi_embedding = QueryCompetitionIndicator(d_model)\n        self.indi_norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n\r\n        self.iter_pred = iter_pred\r\n        self.attn_mask = attn_mask\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        # Extra layers for contrastive losses\r\n        if contrastive_align_loss:\r\n            self.contrastive_align_projection_vision = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(d_model, d_model),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(d_model, d_model),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(d_model, 64))\r\n            self.contrastive_align_projection_text = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(d_model, d_model),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(d_model, d_model),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(d_model, 64))         \r\n        \r\n        self.scg_head = SelfAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout=0, glu=True)\r\n        \r\n    \r\n    def forward_iter_pred(self, x, fps_seed_sp, batch_offsets, lang_feats=None, lang_masks=None, sp_pos=None, feats_2d=None):\r\n        \"\"\"\r\n        x [B*M, inchannel]\r\n        \"\"\"\r\n        \r\n        lang_feats = self.lang_proj(lang_feats) \r\n        lang_feats = self.lang_norm(lang_feats)  \r\n        lang_masks = ~(lang_masks.bool())\r\n        inst_feats = self.input_proj(x)\r\n        \r\n        inst_feats_2d = self.input_proj_2d(feats_2d)\r\n        inst_feats = self.sum_norm(inst_feats+inst_feats_2d)\r\n        \r\n        mask_feats = self.x_mask(x)\r\n        inst_feats, batch_mask = self.get_batches(inst_feats, batch_offsets)\r\n        mask_feats, _ = self.get_batches(mask_feats, batch_offsets)\r\n        \r\n        sp_pos, _ = self.get_batches(sp_pos, batch_offsets)\r\n        \r\n        prediction_masks, prediction_scores, prediction_indis = [], [], []\r\n        \r\n        sample_inds = None\r\n        ref_scores = None\r\n         \r\n        seed_sp = inst_feats.gather(dim=1, index=fps_seed_sp.long().unsqueeze(-1).repeat(1, 1, inst_feats.size(-1)))\r\n        seed_sp_pos = sp_pos.gather(dim=1, index=fps_seed_sp.long().unsqueeze(-1).repeat(1, 1, sp_pos.size(-1)))\r\n        \r\n        scg_weights,scg_mask = self.get_scg_weight(seed_sp_pos)\r\n        # print(scg_weights)\r\n        # print(scg_weights.size())\r\n        # pp\r\n        # seed_sp = self.scg_head(seed_sp, seed_sp, seed_sp, attention_weights = scg_weights)\r\n        seed_sp = self.scg_head(seed_sp, att_weights = scg_weights)\r\n\r\n         # sampling\r\n        if hasattr(self, 'sampling_module') and self.sampling_module is not None:\r\n            sample_inds, ref_scores = self.sampling_module(seed_sp, lang_feats, None, lang_masks)\r\n            sample_inds = sample_inds.long()\r\n            sampled_seed = seed_sp.gather(dim=1, index=sample_inds.unsqueeze(-1).repeat(1, 1, seed_sp.size(-1)))\r\n            query_pos = seed_sp_pos.gather(dim=1, index=sample_inds.unsqueeze(-1).repeat(1, 1, seed_sp_pos.size(-1)))\r\n            query = self.query_generator(sampled_seed)\r\n        else:\r\n            query = self.query_generator(seed_sp)\r\n            query_pos = seed_sp_pos\r\n            \r\n        # scg_weights = self.get_scg_weight(query_pos)\r\n\r\n        proj_queries = []\r\n        if self.contrastive_align_loss:\r\n            proj_queries.append(F.normalize(self.contrastive_align_projection_vision(query), p=2, dim=-1))\r\n        else:\r\n            proj_queries.append(None)\r\n            \r\n        proj_tokens = []\r\n        if self.contrastive_align_loss:\r\n            proj_tokens.append(F.normalize(self.contrastive_align_projection_text(lang_feats), p=2, dim=-1))\r\n        else:\r\n            proj_tokens.append(None)\r\n        \r\n        \r\n        pred_scores, pred_masks, attn_masks = self.prediction_head(query, mask_feats, batch_mask)\n        pred_indis = self.indi_embedding(query, pred_masks, batch_mask)\n        prediction_scores.append(pred_scores)\r\n        prediction_masks.append(pred_masks)\r\n        prediction_indis.append(pred_indis)\r\n        \r\n        lang_query = lang_feats\r\n        \r\n        # multi-round\r\n\r\n        for i in range(self.num_layer):\r\n            \r\n            lang_query = self.lla_layers[i](lang_query, lang_masks)\r\n            lang_query, _, _ = self.lia_layers[i](inst_feats, lang_query, batch_mask, None)\r\n            inst_feats, _, _ = self.ila_layers[i](lang_query, inst_feats, lang_masks, None)\r\n            lang_query = self.lia_ffn_layers[i](lang_query)\r\n            inst_feats = self.ila_ffn_layers[i](inst_feats)\r\n\r\n            coarse_query, coarse_att, _ = self.qia_layers[i](inst_feats, query, batch_mask, attn_masks)\r\n            coarse_query_ffn = self.qia_ffn_layers[i](coarse_query)\r\n            ### 细粒度\r\n            ### 利用coarse_att进行topk选择\r\n            coarse_att = coarse_att * (~batch_mask.unsqueeze(1)).float()\r\n            coarse_att = coarse_att.sum(-2)   # [B, N]\r\n            if coarse_att.shape[1] < self.num_proposal_fine:\r\n                sample_inds_fine = torch.Tensor(list(range(coarse_att.shape[1]))).int().unsqueeze(0).repeat(coarse_att.shape[0], 1).cuda()\r\n            else:   \r\n                sample_inds_fine = torch.topk(coarse_att, self.num_proposal_fine)[1].int() # (bsz, num_proposal_fine)    \r\n            sample_inds_fine = sample_inds_fine.long()\r\n            inst_feats_fine = inst_feats.gather(dim=1, index=sample_inds_fine.unsqueeze(-1).repeat(1, 1, inst_feats.size(-1)))\r\n            inst_feats_fine_pos = sp_pos.gather(dim=1, index=sample_inds_fine.long().unsqueeze(-1).repeat(1, 1, sp_pos.size(-1)))\r\n            scg_weights, scg_mask = self.get_scg_weight(query_pos,pos_k=inst_feats_fine_pos, k=self.num_proposal_query_inst[i]) #2**7 128\r\n            \r\n            fine_query, _, _ = self.qia_layers_fine[i](inst_feats_fine, coarse_query_ffn, attn_mask=~scg_mask, att_weights = scg_weights)\r\n            query_qia = (coarse_query + fine_query)/2\r\n            \r\n\r\n            query_qla, _, _ = self.qla_layers[i](lang_query, query_qia, lang_masks)\r\n            _, scg_mask = self.get_scg_weight(query_pos, k=self.num_proposal_query[i]) #2**7 128\r\n\r\n            query_self = self.qqa_layers[i](query_qla, attn_mask=~scg_mask)\r\n\r\n            query = self.norm_qqa(query_self + query_qla)\r\n\r\n            \r\n            query = self.qqa_ffn_layers[i](query)\r\n\r\n\r\n            pred_scores, pred_masks, attn_masks = self.prediction_head(query, mask_feats, batch_mask)\n            pred_indis = self.indi_embedding(query, pred_masks, batch_mask)\n            prediction_scores.append(pred_scores)\r\n            prediction_masks.append(pred_masks)\r\n            prediction_indis.append(pred_indis)\r\n            if self.contrastive_align_loss:\r\n                proj_queries.append(F.normalize(self.contrastive_align_projection_vision(query), p=2, dim=-1))\r\n            else:\r\n                proj_queries.append(None)\r\n                \r\n            if self.contrastive_align_loss:\r\n                proj_tokens.append(F.normalize(self.contrastive_align_projection_text(lang_query), p=2, dim=-1))\r\n            else:\r\n                proj_tokens.append(None)\r\n\r\n        return {\r\n            'masks': pred_masks,\r\n            'batch_mask': batch_mask,\r\n            'scores': pred_scores,\r\n            'indis': pred_indis, # [B, B_q, 2]\r\n            'proj_queries': proj_queries[-1],\r\n            'proj_tokens': proj_tokens[-1],\r\n            'sample_inds': sample_inds, # [B, K]\r\n            'ref_scores': ref_scores, # [B, M]\r\n            'aux_outputs': [{\r\n                'masks': a,\r\n                'scores': b,\r\n                'proj_queries': c,\r\n                'indis': d,\r\n                'proj_tokens': e,\r\n            } for a, b, c, d, e in zip(\r\n                prediction_masks[:-1],\r\n                prediction_scores[:-1],\r\n                proj_queries[:-1],\r\n                prediction_indis[:-1],\r\n                proj_tokens[:-1],\r\n            )],\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n    def get_batches(self, x, batch_offsets):\r\n        B = len(batch_offsets) - 1\r\n        max_len = max(batch_offsets[1:] - batch_offsets[:-1])\r\n        if torch.is_tensor(max_len):\r\n            max_len = max_len.item()\r\n        new_feats = torch.zeros(B, max_len, x.shape[1]).to(x.device)\r\n        mask = torch.ones(B, max_len, dtype=torch.bool).to(x.device)\r\n        for i in range(B):\r\n            start_idx = batch_offsets[i]\r\n            end_idx = batch_offsets[i + 1]\r\n            cur_len = end_idx - start_idx\r\n            padded_feats = torch.cat([x[start_idx:end_idx], torch.zeros(max_len - cur_len, x.shape[1]).to(x.device)], dim=0)\r\n            new_feats[i] = padded_feats\r\n            mask[i, :cur_len] = False\r\n        mask.detach()\r\n        return new_feats, mask\r\n    \r\n    def get_mask(self, query, mask_feats, batch_mask):\r\n        pred_masks = torch.einsum('bnd,bmd->bnm', query, mask_feats)\r\n        if self.attn_mask:\r\n            attn_masks = (pred_masks.sigmoid() < 0.5).bool() # [B, 1, num_sp]\r\n            attn_masks = attn_masks | batch_mask.unsqueeze(1)\r\n            attn_masks[torch.where(attn_masks.sum(-1) == attn_masks.shape[-1])] = False\r\n            attn_masks = attn_masks | batch_mask.unsqueeze(1)\r\n            attn_masks = attn_masks.detach()\r\n        else:\r\n            attn_masks = None\r\n        return pred_masks, attn_masks\r\n\r\n    def prediction_head(self, query, mask_feats, batch_mask):\r\n        query = self.out_norm(query)\r\n        pred_scores = self.out_score(query)\r\n        pred_masks, attn_masks = self.get_mask(query, mask_feats, batch_mask)\r\n        return pred_scores, pred_masks, attn_masks\r\n\r\n    def get_scg_weight(self, pos_q, pos_k=None, k_mask=None, k=None):\r\n        if pos_k == None: pos_k = pos_q\r\n        # dis = torch.cdist(pos_q, pos_k, p=2)\r\n        dis = ((pos_q.unsqueeze(2)-pos_k.unsqueeze(1))**2).sum(-1)\r\n        if k_mask is not None:\r\n            dis = torch.masked_fill(dis, k_mask.unsqueeze(1).repeat(1,pos_q.shape[1],1), 1000000.0)\r\n        gamma = 0.3  # 可调节参数，控制衰减速度（值越大，权重下降越快）\r\n        scg_weight = torch.exp(-gamma * dis)  # dis越小，att_weights越接近1\r\n        B, N, _ = pos_q.shape\r\n        scg_mask = torch.zeros((pos_q.shape[0],pos_q.shape[1],pos_k.shape[1]),device=pos_q.device).bool()\r\n        if k is not None:\r\n            ind = torch.topk(dis, k, dim=-1, largest=False)[1]\r\n            i_indices = torch.arange(B, device=dis.device)[:, None, None].expand(-1, N, k)\r\n            j_indices = torch.arange(N, device=dis.device)[None, :, None].expand(B, -1, k)\r\n            scg_mask[i_indices, j_indices, ind] = True\r\n        else:\r\n            scg_mask=None\r\n        return scg_weight, scg_mask\r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, x, fps_seed_sp, batch_offsets, lang_feats=None, lang_masks=None, sp_pos=None, feats_2d=None):\r\n        if self.iter_pred:\r\n            return self.forward_iter_pred(x, fps_seed_sp, batch_offsets, lang_feats, lang_masks, sp_pos, feats_2d)\r\n        else:\r\n            raise NotImplementedError\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
